# Faqqa (فقاعة) Android Environment Configuration
# Firebase AI Logic (Gemini), Firestore, Auth, and App Check are configured via
# google-services.json and firebase_applet_config.xml (no GEMINI_API_KEY needed).
#
# Optional third-party AI provider keys (DeepSeek, Groq, OpenAI, Anthropic)
# are entered securely inside the app's AI Settings screen and encrypted on-device
# with Android Keystore AES-256-GCM.
